### flatten_option

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl flatten_option forall t u. (x : option (result (option t) u)) : result (option t) u =\n    match x with\n    | Some (Error x) => Error x\n    | Some (Ok (Some x)) => Ok (Some x)\n    | _ => Ok None","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl flatten_option forall t u. (x : option (result (option t) u)) : result (option t) u =
      match x with
      | Some (Error x) => Error x
      | Some (Ok (Some x)) => Ok (Some x)
      | _ => Ok None
  """,
