### transpose

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl transpose forall t u. (x : optionm'.option' (result' t u)) : result' (optionm'.option' t) u =\n    if result'_union ()\n    then\n        inl r : result (optionm'.option' t) u =\n            match optionm'.unbox x with\n            | Some x =>\n                match unbox x with\n                | Ok x => Ok (optionm'.some' x)\n                | Error e => Error e\n            | None => Ok (optionm'.none' ())\n        box r\n    else !\\\\(x, $'\"$0.transpose()\"')","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl transpose forall t u. (x : optionm'.option' (result' t u)) : result' (optionm'.option' t) u =
      if result'_union ()
      then
          inl r : result (optionm'.option' t) u =
              match optionm'.unbox x with
              | Some x =>
                  match unbox x with
                  | Ok x => Ok (optionm'.some' x)
                  | Error e => Error e
              | None => Ok (optionm'.none' ())
          box r
      else !\\(x, $'"$0.transpose()"')
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

